 way\, France\, Finland\, Denmark\, Sweden\n(Romanian\, English\, Norwegian
 )\n\n𝗥𝗲𝗮𝗹𝗶𝘀𝗮𝘁𝗲𝘂𝗿 : Cristian Mungiu\n𝗦
